<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Avonmore EGM approves share capital change.</title>
<headline>Avonmore EGM approves share capital change.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Avonmore Foods Plc said shareholders approved a proposed amendment to its share capital structure at an extraordinary meeting on Monday.</p>
<p>Shareholders approved the creation of one class of ordinary share and application will now be made to the Irish and London Stock Exchanges for one million ordinary shares to be listed, Avonmore said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
</text>
